                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Scalability</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">Parallel processing will eliminate the problems in existing
                    sequential transactions. The network will integrate a nested relay chain to increase the number
                    shards in the future. The network can be parallel processed by increasing the number of shards.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Upgradeability</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">Polkadot’s transparent on-chain governance system supports the
                    upgrade of blockchains without needing to use chain forks. This allows Polkadot projects to evolve
                    with technology.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group fs-24 fc-b"></i>
                  <h5 class="card-title mt-2">Transparent Governance</h5>
                  <p class="card-text">The sophisticated governance mechanism of Polkadot manages the
                    Polkadot network. It ensures transparency, accountability, and binding processes for updating the
                    network. Governance token holders vote on proposals to upgrade the protocol and create them.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>


          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

